{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04560","headline":"答李伯鱼桐竹 · 张说","name":"答李伯鱼桐竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结庐桐竹下，室迩人相深。\n接垣分竹径，隔户共桐阴。\n落花朝满岸，明月夜披林。\n竹有龙鸣管，桐留凤舞琴。\n奇声与高节，非吾谁赏心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04560.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04560","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}